  {
   "excerpt_id": "o13_board_limit_py",
   "original": "D:\\PycharmProjects\\OSkhQuant1.3\\oskh_core\\board_limit.py",
   "original_sha256": "eae297c9476e74a19821421dc6e6f9bf2b183465ad997e869e759da9fb3c8cd8",
   "repo_head": "47afc2447fa4df5b37af1400ec1aea419ed7fda1",
   "lines": [
    {
     "line": 1,
     "text": "\"\"\"Board 涨跌停幅度规则表（静态前缀规则，非 L2 指标）。"
    },
    {
     "line": 2,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 3,
     "text": "2026-09-09 自 ``l2_analytics/board_limit.py`` 收编（迁移 plan r1.2 质证："
    },
    {
     "line": 4,
     "text": "该函数与 L2 数据/分析无关，仅物理上曾住在 l2_analytics 包内）。与"
    },
    {
     "line": 5,
     "text": "``oskh_core.a_share_symbol_normalize`` 同族——板块规则 SSOT。"
    },
    {
     "line": 6,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 7,
     "text": "Mirrors ``hkcodex_miniqmt._get_limit_pct`` equity prefixes and adds **302**"
    },
    {
     "line": 8,
     "text": "(创业板段, SSOT in ``oskh_core.a_share_symbol_normalize``). ST 5% is not applied"
    },
    {
     "line": 9,
     "text": "here (no name feed) — treat estimates as board-rule only."
    },
    {
     "line": 10,
     "text": "\"\"\""
    },
    {
     "line": 11,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 12,
     "text": "from __future__ import annotations"
    },
    {
     "line": 13,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 14,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 15,
     "text": "def board_limit_pct(stock_code: str) -> float:"
    },
    {
     "line": 16,
     "text": "    \"\"\"Return limit ratio (0.10 / 0.20 / 0.30) from bare or canonical code.\"\"\""
    },
    {
     "line": 17,
     "text": "    code = str(stock_code).strip().upper()"
    },
    {
     "line": 18,
     "text": "    if \".\" in code:"
    },
    {
     "line": 19,
     "text": "        code = code.split(\".\", 1)[0]"
    },
    {
     "line": 20,
     "text": "    if code.startswith((\"300\", \"301\", \"302\")):"
    },
    {
     "line": 21,
     "text": "        return 0.20"
    },
    {
     "line": 22,
     "text": "    if code.startswith((\"688\", \"689\")):"
    },
    {
     "line": 23,
     "text": "        return 0.20"
    },
    {
     "line": 24,
     "text": "    if code.startswith((\"8\", \"4\", \"9\")):  # BJ coarse"
    },
    {
     "line": 25,
     "text": "        return 0.30"
    },
    {
     "line": 26,
     "text": "    if code.startswith((\"11\", \"12\")):  # convertible (not used in stock templates)"
    },
    {
     "line": 27,
     "text": "        return 0.20"
    },
    {
     "line": 28,
     "text": "    return 0.10"
    },
    {
     "line": 29,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 30,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 31,
     "text": "# DuckDB expression on canonical ``stock_code`` (e.g. 000001.SZ)."
    },
    {
     "line": 32,
     "text": "BOARD_LIMIT_PCT_SQL = \"\"\""
    },
    {
     "line": 33,
     "text": "CASE"
    },
    {
     "line": 34,
     "text": "  WHEN split_part(stock_code, '.', 1) LIKE '300%'"
    },
    {
     "line": 35,
     "text": "    OR split_part(stock_code, '.', 1) LIKE '301%'"
    },
    {
     "line": 36,
     "text": "    OR split_part(stock_code, '.', 1) LIKE '302%' THEN 0.20"
    },
    {
     "line": 37,
     "text": "  WHEN split_part(stock_code, '.', 1) LIKE '688%'"
    },
    {
     "line": 38,
     "text": "    OR split_part(stock_code, '.', 1) LIKE '689%' THEN 0.20"
    },
    {
     "line": 39,
     "text": "  WHEN split_part(stock_code, '.', 1) LIKE '8%'"
    },
    {
     "line": 40,
     "text": "    OR split_part(stock_code, '.', 1) LIKE '4%'"
    },
    {
     "line": 41,
     "text": "    OR split_part(stock_code, '.', 1) LIKE '9%' THEN 0.30"
    },
    {
     "line": 42,
     "text": "  ELSE 0.10"
    },
    {
     "line": 43,
     "text": "END"
    },
    {
     "line": 44,
     "text": "\"\"\".strip()"
    }
   ],
   "note": "1.3 板块涨跌幅规则 SSOT：主板0.10 创业/科创0.20 北交0.30；ST 5% 不在此(无名称馈源)。approved_derivation 规则材料实现旁证。"
  },
  {
   "excerpt_id": "o13_limit_rate_and_prices",
   "original": "D:\\PycharmProjects\\OSkhQuant1.3\\common\\integrations\\qmt_xtdata_mock.py",
   "original_sha256": "3a1eea985b41adb2812dffa613cfb3d6447d11892a53de981726bd4fdc5eba05",
