   "lines": [
    {
     "line": 31,
     "text": "def _get_limit_rate(symbol: str, *, st: bool = False) -> float:"
    },
    {
     "line": 32,
     "text": "    \"\"\"Get board-specific limit rate (#15 回测数据对齐)."
    },
    {
     "line": 33,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 34,
     "text": "    主板(00/60) → 10%, 创业板(30)/科创板(68) → 20%, 北交所(4/8/92) → 30%."
    },
    {
     "line": 35,
     "text": "    Aligned with backtest/LimitUpDownManager.py."
    },
    {
     "line": 36,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 37,
     "text": "    ``st=True``（研究层显式声明，LEBS ``--st-symbols``）：主板风险警示股"
    },
    {
     "line": 38,
     "text": "    ±5%；创业/科创 ST 仍 20%、北交仍 30%——ST 档只覆盖主板宽度。"
    },
    {
     "line": 39,
     "text": "    live 侧 ST 由柜台真实涨跌停价兜底，不经本旗标。"
    },
    {
     "line": 40,
     "text": "    \"\"\""
    },
    {
     "line": 41,
     "text": "    code = str(symbol).strip().upper().replace(\".SH\", \"\").replace(\".SZ\", \"\").replace(\".BJ\", \"\")"
    },
    {
     "line": 42,
     "text": "    if not code:"
    },
    {
     "line": 43,
     "text": "        return 0.05 if st else 0.10"
    },
    {
     "line": 44,
     "text": "    if code.startswith((\"30\",)):"
    },
    {
     "line": 45,
     "text": "        return 0.20"
    },
    {
     "line": 46,
     "text": "    if code.startswith((\"68\",)):"
    },
    {
     "line": 47,
     "text": "        return 0.20"
    },
    {
     "line": 48,
     "text": "    if code.startswith((\"4\", \"8\", \"92\")):"
    },
    {
     "line": 49,
     "text": "        return 0.30"
    },
    {
     "line": 50,
     "text": "    return 0.05 if st else 0.10"
    },
    {
     "line": 51,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 52,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 53,
     "text": "def _limit_prices(pre_close: float, symbol: str, *, st: bool = False) -> \"tuple[float, float]\":"
    },
    {
     "line": 54,
     "text": "    \"\"\"涨跌停价 = 前收盘 × (1 ± 板块率)——全 mock 体系**单源**（LEBS PR-1 统一）。"
    },
    {
     "line": 55,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 56,
     "text": "    消费方：`_default_tick` / `inject_history_bars` / 两侧 `_tick_from_script_entry`"
    },
    {
     "line": 57,
     "text": "    / limit-info 回退。禁止在任何派生 tick 处再写死 ±1.1/0.9——主板 10% 恰好"
    },
    {
     "line": 58,
     "text": "    等于 1.1/0.9，创业/科创 20%、北交 30% 下写死值即错（2026-08-26 矛盾修复）。"
    },
    {
     "line": 59,
     "text": "    ``st`` 语义见 ``_get_limit_rate``。"
    },
    {
     "line": 60,
     "text": "    \"\"\""
    },
    {
     "line": 61,
     "text": "    rate = _get_limit_rate(symbol, st=st)"
    },
    {
     "line": 62,
     "text": "    return round(float(pre_close) * (1 + rate), 2), round(float(pre_close) * (1 - rate), 2)"
    }
   ],
   "note": "1.3 mock 单源涨跌停价=前收盘×(1±板块率) round 0.01；主板 ST ±5%(研究层显式声明)；live 侧柜台真实涨跌停价兜底。"
  },
